 1116 f6d0:             ; vidctl: the video entry at $FFBC (JSR vidctl / RET, below the full vector table), for Y1/OS and programs.
 1117 f6d0:             ; ACC = 0 probe (ACC = VIDPRES), 1 init (V I), 2 clear + home (V C); anything else: ACC = VIDPRES.
 1118 f6d0:             ; A caller checks that $FFBC holds $04 (JSR) first: an older ROM has $FF there. Clobbers R5-R7, TMP.
